            <ArticleTitle>Masquerade: medical causes of back pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>905-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Back pain has many causes, and 95% of cases are due to benign, self-limiting problems. Most problems are musculoskeletal and are relieved with rest and nonsteroidal medications. However, some serious and life-threatening medical conditions also can present as acute back pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
